      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A grayish blue rampaging bull with two horns, which sometimes breathes fire and shoots fire balls out.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 20, touch 9; flat-footed 20 (+11 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 126 [168] (12d10+60)</p><p>Fort +12, Ref +8, Will +7</p><p>Resist Fire 5</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +18 (1d6+7), Gore +19 (2d6+7)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Impale, Fireball, Fire Breath (20-ft.-cone, 7d6 fire damage, Reflex DC 20 half, usable every 1d4 rounds)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 24, Dex 11, Con 18, Int 6, Wis 12, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +12; CMB +20 (+22 overrun); CMD 30 (32 vs. overrun, 34 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Charge Through, Improved Natural Attack (Gore), Iron Will, Power Attack, Toughness, Weapon Focus (Gore)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +6, Climb +11, Perception +9, Survival +4</p>"
